{"id":"n62365-4-4","stage":1,"title":"부치다 · 交付","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62365-4-4-1","ko":"원고 교정은 거의 끝났습니다.","zh":"稿件的校对差不多已经完成了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"원고","meaning":"原稿","explanation":"원고：原稿","readings":[{"term":"원고","audio":"/audio/799a32d4de2c6ba1989c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91717","senseId":"1","lemma":"원고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"교정은","meaning":"校对","explanation":"교정：校对；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"교정","audio":"/audio/0439cb7335c34164cecc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"35145","senseId":"1","lemma":"교정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거의","meaning":"大部分，基本上","explanation":"거의：大部分，基本上","readings":[{"term":"거의","audio":"/audio/1b1da423b101b5518eb2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60090","senseId":"1","lemma":"거의","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끝났습니다.","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"끝나다：结束，完成；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"1","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"799a32d4de2c6ba1","term":"원고","zh":"原稿","audio":"/audio/799a32d4de2c6ba1989c.mp3","entryId":"91717","definition":"为打印或发表而写的文字或画的图画。","pronunciation":["원고"]},{"id":"0439cb7335c34164","term":"교정","zh":"校对","audio":"/audio/0439cb7335c34164cecc.mp3","entryId":"35145","definition":"对照原稿与印刷本，改正错别字、错排、排列、颜色等。","pronunciation":["교ː정"]},{"id":"1b1da423b101b551","term":"거의","zh":"大部分，基本上","audio":"/audio/1b1da423b101b5518eb2.mp3","entryId":"60090","definition":"比全部少一点点。","pronunciation":["거의","거이"]},{"id":"80a25f4e1416ded1","term":"끝나다","zh":"结束，完成","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3","entryId":"34734","definition":"事情做完。","pronunciation":["끈나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7dde1d56000edf989658.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62365-4-4-2","ko":"그래? 그럼 오늘 저녁까지 인쇄에 부쳐.","zh":"是吗？那就在今天晚上之前把稿子送去印刷吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"그래：真的","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저녁까지","meaning":"傍晚","explanation":"저녁：傍晚；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71220","senseId":"1","lemma":"저녁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인쇄에","meaning":"印刷，打印","explanation":"인쇄：印刷，打印；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"인쇄","audio":"/audio/3ee1ff52e0e8a051acf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25101","senseId":"1","lemma":"인쇄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부쳐.","meaning":"交付","explanation":"부치다：交付；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"부치다","audio":"/audio/b3fb1e23969565512601.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62365","senseId":"4","lemma":"부치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于对对方所说的话表示感叹或轻微的惊讶。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"8d3c547011f433e6","term":"저녁","zh":"傍晚","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3","entryId":"71220","definition":"从太阳落山开始到晚上的时间。","pronunciation":["저녁"]},{"id":"3ee1ff52e0e8a051","term":"인쇄","zh":"印刷，打印","audio":"/audio/3ee1ff52e0e8a051acf2.mp3","entryId":"25101","definition":"用机器将文字、文章或图画等印在纸或布等之上。","pronunciation":["인쇄"]},{"id":"b3fb1e2396956551","term":"부치다","zh":"交付","audio":"/audio/b3fb1e23969565512601.mp3","entryId":"62365","definition":"将稿件移交以印刷。","pronunciation":["부치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/67f63519663495b4f2e3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.65,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62365","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"초급","day":52,"sequenceScore":2.3034,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["稿件的校对差不多已经完成了。","是吗？那就在今天晚上之前把稿子送去印刷吧。","怎么办！衣服上洒到饮料了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["稿件的校对差不多已经完成了。","是吗？那就在今天晚上之前把稿子送去印刷吧。","怎么办！衣服上洒到饮料了。"],"answer":1}]}
